Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜星光体：由于纹章之力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去了 一飞冲天 的游马
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连斗志和 不放弃挑战的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.85,0:00:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心气都失去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 相信自己的力量……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信与同伴之间的羁绊吧！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.19,0:00:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游……游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（III）你已经没有战斗的气力了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.23,0:00:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好……好可怕……好可怕啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖放一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.58,0:00:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 放马过来吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.90,0:00:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……不要……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.57,0:00:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么我非得和那些怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.42,0:00:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗不可啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.55,0:00:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.99,0:00:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）总觉得有点不对劲啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:00:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）游马君……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.35,0:01:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）你在干什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轮到你的回合了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.57,0:01:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡。抽卡啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…我的回合…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.25,0:01:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要…把决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.82,0:01:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把决斗投降掉…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.87,0:01:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.45,0:03:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去了“一飞冲天”的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然这么胆小啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.09,0:03:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎…“一飞冲天”是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把游马的“一飞冲天”和星光体都封印了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.27,0:03:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看看那个吧！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）星光体！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那个地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（III）把“一飞冲天”和星光体
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去一切的游马，只剩下恐惧心。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.53,0:03:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）太卑鄙了，你这混蛋！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）就是啊！就是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）太过分了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}随便你们怎么说。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.61,0:03:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，很遗憾我不接受你的投降！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你会败给我然后被夺走一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.11,0:03:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我马上就会让你解脱的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:03:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做好觉悟吧，九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:04:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就在这里败亡吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.56,0:04:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.77,0:04:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系。游马还有魔像在……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可没那么天真！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧帕兹怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.30,0:04:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤 疯狂魔像·石像鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（III）守备表示的隆隆隆魔像
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中不会被破坏来着。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 对我来说毫无意义。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.59,0:04:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 疯狂魔像·石像鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击隆隆隆魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.48,0:04:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}城门激光！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽在攻击守备怪兽时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.65,0:04:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力超过守备力的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会给玩家造成伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}furthermore 发动速攻魔法 石之心！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 当欧帕兹怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中未能将对手的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:04:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只怪兽可以再次进行攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}疯狂魔像·石像鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.77,0:05:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉碎隆隆隆魔像！！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.02,0:05:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}城门激光！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.16,0:05:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（III）这样一来 能保护你的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经什么都不剩了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束了 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 玛修·马克！ 弗利尔之火！！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.01,0:05:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是正面挨下那招到头来就全完了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 我最后的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.23,0:05:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想起来吧 一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《什么啊 这是什么》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.07,0:06:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 我我我守卫者特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.03,0:06:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错哦 游马君。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.65,0:06:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我守卫者在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.89,0:06:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到直接攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游、游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.39,0:06:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能 为什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.85,0:06:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊，星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体你竟敢来碍事！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.93,0:07:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.28,0:07:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.63,0:07:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，别放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这是怎么回事…》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，就再也没有人能帮你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.53,0:07:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:07:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请冷静下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.51,0:07:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底这里是AR空间。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算游马同学万一掉下去…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.41,0:08:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊你忘了现实中的这个地方吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，对哦，这里是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海上正在建设中的道路。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.57,0:08:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，振作点！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.49,0:08:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 你们会……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然啦 我们是同伴吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 和你们是同伴？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.61,0:08:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是同伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.91,0:08:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 真的把所有事都忘光了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 不管什么时候都是个不放弃的家伙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.38,0:08:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论面对怎样的危机都会勇敢地迎上去。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我所认识的游马就是这样的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我勇敢…… 和你们是同伴？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闲聊到此为止。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.09,0:09:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还没 把你们在这件事给忘掉呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.65,0:09:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.11,0:09:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我要把你的一切都夺走！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的！只要在那里面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.80,0:09:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就听不到你们的声音。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.03,0:09:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！我们的声音也传不到！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:09:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体也不在！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（一马）居然使出了这么卑鄙的手段。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一次 光靠你一个人的力量似乎无济于事。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.85,0:10:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最重要的事情可别忘了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（一马）想起来吧 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.23,0:11:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我教过你的那些。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.98,0:11:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗饭…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！用这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《想起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:11:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我教给你的……》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.79,0:12:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！我忘记的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是一飞冲天啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游……游马他！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.66,0:12:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然能打破托隆纹章的力量……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}III！你靠纹章的力量居然做到这种地步……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你也送到星光体那里去！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.10,0:12:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.94,0:12:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体在哪！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很遗憾，星光体已经不在了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么意思啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是字面意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.27,0:12:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体消灭了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:12:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.33,0:13:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也应该看到了。　那消灭的瞬间。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.60,0:13:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……骗人的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的！　骗人的～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙　不可能抛下我去别的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.58,0:13:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂　小鸟！　铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.00,0:13:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟……　怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.19,0:13:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（III）真是不见棺材不掉泪！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.45,0:13:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体是被我的纹章之力消灭的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.45,0:13:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.96,0:13:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要　保护自己的家人。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.88,0:13:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为此　我不会挑手段。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧　决斗重新开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.75,0:13:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动　场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古代遗物都市·巴比伦的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.19,0:13:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地里的　古代遗物怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿兹特克假面魔像除外
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将相同等级的　卡布雷拉投石机
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.47,0:14:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 你的生命值 已经 只剩400了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.92,0:14:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的场上有 卡布雷拉投石机 和
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.33 马赫·麦克。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经没有获胜的机会了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 连同你的一飞冲天一起我要把你彻底碾碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}III… 我绝对不可原谅你！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.46,0:14:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好想想 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 该做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错 那家伙就在我的心里。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想起来… 给我想起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙说过的 一字一句》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.22,0:14:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.78,0:15:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来 教教你决斗的心得。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？ 为什么 我要被你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.81,0:15:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天 当你独自战斗的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.47,0:15:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知何时就会消失。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.05,0:15:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但你还有未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还留有无限的可能性。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我想留下我曾经存在过的证明。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.64,0:15:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在你的记忆中…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.41,0:15:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我绝对不会放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是为了那家伙！》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.31,0:15:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先 要看穿对手的意图。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论组出多么强力的卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦被带进对方的节奏 就无法掌握
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗的主导权
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.49,0:15:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《III的目标是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡布雷拉投石机和马修·麦克的连招。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那招一旦成功 我就输了》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看穿敌人的意图阻止它
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《也就是说 只能破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡布雷拉的投石机或者马修·麦克其中之一》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.19,0:16:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊 是你留给我的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.09,0:16:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来 就像你的风格
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.18,0:16:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.57,0:16:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.49,0:16:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你一起战斗过的记忆是我的血肉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.49,0:16:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 装备魔法 我我我复仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.10,0:16:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡让墓地的我我我怪兽复活
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并装备在那只怪兽身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.03,0:16:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 我召唤 满精灵！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}满精灵 一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将手牌的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:16:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送入墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.23,0:16:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让那只怪兽的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己的等级 加上！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.43,0:17:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 等级2的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.69,0:17:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量食人魔送去墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.35,0:17:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让富尔艾尔夫的等级上升到4！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 等级4的 我我我魔术师和富尔艾尔夫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.98,0:17:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.23,0:17:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.47,0:17:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.35,0:17:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.08,0:17:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 星光体
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}留给我的 最后的希望。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.20,0:17:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望？ 你还觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有那种东西吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.93,0:17:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 有啊！ 就在我的心中！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.64,0:17:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝不会熄灭的 希望之火！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 星光体留给我的一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.45,0:18:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动装备魔法 我我我复仇的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.31,0:18:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了这张卡的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为超量素材的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只怪兽超量的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.82,0:18:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升３００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.55,0:18:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击棉花糖！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.05,0:18:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑 双刃射击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.89,0:18:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.94,0:18:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.22,0:18:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有星光体 到底 为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪需要什么道理。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 我和星光体的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.81,0:18:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:19:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可原谅… 不可原谅啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.85,0:19:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放马过来 III！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的力量 可不只有棉花糖！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合……抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.93,0:19:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将卡布雷拉的投石机解放
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上级召唤欧帕兹怪兽 太阳方尖碑！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太阳方尖碑召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将场上的其他怪兽的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变更为6。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.85,0:19:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将疯狂魔像·石像鬼的等级提升为6。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.85,0:19:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级6的太阳方尖碑和
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}疯狂魔像·石像鬼进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.01,0:19:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.39,0:19:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.70,0:19:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.78,0:19:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识一下吧……这就是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从托隆那里继承来的 新的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.79,0:19:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.6！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.02,0:20:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧帕兹怪兽 亚特兰塔尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新的 No.……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.07,0:20:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亚特兰塔尔的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个效果是在超量召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将墓地里的 No.作为装备卡装备。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.83,0:20:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算装备「马修·麦克」吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.59,0:20:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变成5000了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马修·麦克的攻击力被加上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.85,0:21:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿托兰塔尔！攻击霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神圣惩罚！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.09,0:21:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.96,0:21:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.86,0:21:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月之护盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.81,0:21:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.49,0:21:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.37,0:21:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿托兰塔尔的力量可不止这点！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.24,0:21:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿托兰塔尔的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗1个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.68,0:21:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方的生命值减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.19,0:21:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥利哈刚之门！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.54,0:21:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.62,0:21:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次一定要给你致命一击。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.81,0:21:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎…想得美。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.53,0:22:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.75,0:22:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.56,0:22:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.51,0:22:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和星光体的一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.93,0:23:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.59,0:23:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.71,0:23:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.61,0:23:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.12,0:23:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.04,0:24:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.20,0:24:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.04,0:24:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.26,0:24:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.27,0:24:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天要介绍的怪兽是管魔人 迷迷旋律。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果是能吃哈密瓜哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.98,0:24:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}管魔人 迷迷旋律。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.58,0:24:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果对方场上还有怪兽超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.86,0:24:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能再次攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.12,0:24:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦 哈密瓜去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.37,0:24:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差不多该住手了。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.85,0:24:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？

